        "description": "Export people profiles with verified emails based on company and contact filters. Returns a `trackId` immediately. Results are delivered asynchronously and stored for retrieval. The worst-case profile plus email cost is reserved first, then settled from exported profiles and valid emails found. Credits: variable per exported profile + verified email \u2014 profile=1.03, verified_email=1.03; reserved up-front, settled to actual (see X-ColdIQ-Credits-Charged).",
